  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/icon/ICON_0011010">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Cal-IPC: severe ecological impacts on physical processes, plant and animal communities and vegetation structure, with rates of dispersal and establishment that are moderate to high; most are widely distributed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
